The public MMTLS verification pins and business ECDH/signature pins are public
protocol constants from the Linux 4.1.13.26 default configuration. They are not
account credentials. Reference artifact SHA-256:
2749535f299ba67feb8ef80cab898bb0531fa8f376b16f8a72db706811c84132

Other test vectors contain synthetic inputs, RFC 5869 test-case 1 data, or
independently generated Python cryptography/zlib ciphertext. No private capture,
account identity, token, device state, message, or runtime executable is shipped.

